// fill one cell's value down into every ticked row. Built because 24 of 129 agents
// were unsellable (no programs / no rateType) and fixing that one modal at a time
// is absurd.
//
// TRAP (cost us a whole import once): company details are NESTED under
// companyInfo — writing them flat means the relational backend has no column and
// drops them silently. Every read/write below goes through agGet/agSet, which
// understand 'companyInfo.legalName' and MERGE rather than replace the object.
// ══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
let _agView   = 'card';     // 'card' | 'table'
